# Learn: the first six lessons by their required actions — an Ember card on
# the Ember discard, the matching rank, a draw (D) when nothing matches, the
# Skip, the Draw Two, then a Wild and its colour (the mandatory chooser) —
# each to its "Lesson complete" dialog and on to the next lesson.
until 300 Color Eights
frames 20
click Learn
until 60 Interactive lessons
frames 10
save learn
click Match a Color
until 200 Your turn
frames 30
save lesson1
click =Ember 4
until 120 Lesson complete
frames 10
save lesson1-done
click Next lesson
until 200 Colors do not match here
frames 20
click =Tide 4
until 120 Lesson complete
frames 10
click Next lesson
until 200 Nothing matches
frames 20
key KeyD 2
until 120 Lesson complete
frames 10
click Next lesson
until 200 Skip jumps over
frames 20
click =Ember Skip
until 120 Lesson complete
frames 10
click Next lesson
until 200 Draw Two makes
frames 20
click =Sol Draw Two
until 120 Lesson complete
frames 10
click Next lesson
until 200 Wild cards play on anything
frames 20
click =Wild
until 120 Choose a color
frames 10
save chooser
click =Tide
until 120 Lesson complete
frames 10
click Back to lessons
until 60 Interactive lessons
frames 10
save learn-done
